# CODEOWNERS.example — copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and adjust the owners.
#
# This is the review gate for the harness itself: changes to what every
# teammate's agent reads (shared memory, rules, hooks, root instructions) get a
# human review before they merge. Access control is the repo's GitHub/GitLab
# permissions; CODEOWNERS is the *curation* gate on top.
#
# Listed owners are auto-requested as reviewers on any PR touching these paths.
# Pair with branch protection ("require review from Code Owners") to enforce it.

# Curated shared team memory — the team's brain. Vet every change.
/knowledge/team-memory/      @your-handle

# Agent harness: hooks, settings, agents, commands, orchestration broker.
/.claude/                    @your-handle

# Cross-tool + root agent instructions.
/AGENTS.md                   @your-handle
/CLAUDE.md                   @your-handle
